<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">John Khatna</book>
  <para style="h">John Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc1">John Khatna</para>
  <para style="toc2">John Khatna</para>
  <para style="mt">John Khatna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kipatciil pan a omsa, nuntakna Kammal huvau note tungah lai kong thaak hi. Tua thu ka za zo uh a, ka mit taw ka mu zo uh hi; hi hi, mu zo khu hi, ka khut uh taw tham zo khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi nuntakna sia a kimu thei in hong kilangh ciang, kote in ka mu uh hi; tua ahikom tua thu ka son uh hi, tuaciang koma hong heaksak ahi, Pa taw a omkhawm, tua tawntung nuntakna thu sia no tung zongh ah kong son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pa le a Tapa Jesus Christ taw ka kipawlkhopna sungah nong pop thei natu in, ka mu ka zaak uh teng no tungah kong phuang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kote lungdamna a pawlcin thei natu in tua thu kong at uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu in a Tapa tung pan ka zaak thu le kong zaaksak uh thu in hi thu ahi hi: Pathian sia khuavak hi a, ama sungah khuazing om ngawl het hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama taw a kipawl khawm hi hing ci napi, khuazing sungah ih om veve le ih kampauna le ih ngamtatna ah a leilot ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang eite khuavak sungah ih nungta le — ama sia khuavak sungah om ahi bangma in — eite khat le khat a kipawl theite ih hi a, tuasia ciangin a Tapa Jesus ii chisan in ih mawna theampo pan hong thiansua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mawna nei bua hing ih cile eima le eima kitheam ih hi a, ih sungah thumaan thutak om ngawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang ih mawnate Pathian tungah ih pualaak le ama in a kamciamte keam tu a, tuaciang a maan sia seam hi: ama in ih mawnate hong maisak tu a, ih ngamtat khialna theampo pan hong thiansua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maw ngei bua hing ih cile Pathian sia a leilot pa ih suaksak a, ama kammal eite sungah a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka tate awng, mawna khialna na vawt ngawl natu in hi lai kong at hi; ahihang khat po in mawna a vawt le Pa mai ah ei taangin hong ngetsak tu khat — thutangpa Jesus Christ ih nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Christ mama in eite ii mawna bek hi ngawlin a kuama po ii mawna zongh maisakna a pianna pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian thupiakte ih zui le tuasia ciangin ama a he ih hi hunlam ih tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khat po in ama ka he hi ci napi, a thupiakte a zui buale mihing leilot hi a, ama sungah thumaan thutak a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang a kuama po a kammal a zui sia in Pathian a itna kicingtaaksak takpi zo hi. Pathian taw pumkhat ih hina hi thu in hong telsak thei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian taw pumkhatin nungta ing a cite in Jesus Christ ii nuntak bangin a nuntak kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka it lawmte awng, tu a kong at hi thupiakna sia thuthak hi ngawl hi; tuasia in thupiak lui hi a, a kipatciil pan ma na neisa uh ahi hi. Thupiak lui sia noma ii zaaksa thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang tu a kong at thupiakna sia a thak hi, banghang ziam cile tua ii a maanna sia Christ sungah kimu a, no sung zongh ah kimu hi. Banghang ziam cile khuazing om nawn ngawl a, khuavak tatak sia taang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kuama po khuavak sungah ka om ci napi a, a suapuite a ensan le ama in tu dong ma in khuazing sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A suapuite a it te sia khuavak sungah teang ahikom ama sungah ngualdang khat khialsak thei natu bangma a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang a suapuipa a ensan khat pawpo sia khuazing sungah om ahi hi; ama khuazing sungah lampai a, khuazing in a mit tawsak ahikom, a zot natu he ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tate awng, na mawnate uh Christ hangin hong kimaisak zo ahikom lai hong thaak ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pate awng, a kipatciil pan a om pa na heak uh manin lai kong thaak hi. Tangvalte awng, Ngilo Pa zo zo na hi uh manin lai kong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tate awng, Pa na heak uh manin, lai kong thaak hi. Pate awng, a kipatciil pan a om pa sia na heak uh manin lai kong thaak hi. Tangvalte awng, note na tha uh hat ahikom lai kong thaak hi; Pathian kammal no sungah nungta hi, Ngilo Pa na zo zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leitung ahizong leitung na khat pawpo ahizong na it heak vun. Leitung na it uh le Pa it ngawl na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leitung neisa ahi — hong mawsak thei eima atu lungngulnate, mite ii mit taw mu in a dei sia le mihingte kiphatsakpui leitung na theampo — hite sia khat beak zongh Pa kung pan hong pai ahi bua hi; a vekpi in leitung pan hong pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitung le a sungah a om, mihingte lungngul thei na theampo hong bo tu hi; ahihang Pathian ii deina bangin a seamte in a tawntungin nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tate awng, hun bo tu hong nai zo hi! Christ ii Ngalpa hong pai tu hi ci in no tungah hong kison zo hi; tu in Christ ii ngalte tam mama hong kilangh zo a, tua ahikom hun bo tu sia nai zo hi ci in ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi mite in ei kipawlna sungah hong om tatak ngawl ahi hu in ei hong nusia hi; ei pawl sungah hong om hile ei taw hong omkhawm top tu hi. Ahihang eite taw hong kipawlkhawm tatak ngawl ahi hunlam a kithiangtel thei natu in amate in hong nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang Christ ii no tungah Thaa Thiangtho hong buak sia na saang zo uh hi, tua ahikom na vekpi in thumaan thutak na tel uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom lai kong thaakna in thumaan thutak na tel ngawl uh hang hi ngawl hi; thumaan thutak na heak uh hang hi zaw a, tuaciangin thumaan thutak sung pan leilot thu hong piang ngeingawl ci zongh na heak uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahile a leilot pa sia akua ziam? Jesus sia Messiah hi ngawl hi a ci pawpo in leilot pa ahi hi. Tuabang mihingte sia Christ ii Ngalte ahi uh hi — amate in Pa le Tapa nial khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Tapa a nial pawpo in Pa zongh nial hi. Tapa a saang pawpo in Pa zongh nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahiciang a kipat pan na zaak uh ngupna thu sia noma thinsung uh ah na keamcing hamtang tavun. Tua thu na keamcing uh le Pa le Tapa taw pumkhatin na nungta tawntung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaciangin Christ ama mama ii eite hong piak tu hong kamciam sia — tawntung nuntakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Note hong theam tu a hong kipante ii thu hong at khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang note na hi uh le, Christ in a Thaa no tungah hong buak zo hi. Note sungah ama Thaa a om laitengin hong hil tu kuama dang na kitaangsamh bua uh hi. Banghang ziam cile ama Thaa in na theampo huvau hong hil a, hong hil teng sia thumaan hi a, khial ngawl hi. Tua Thaa ii hilna na ni vun a, Christ taw pumkhat in na om vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi hi, ka tate awng, ama taw pumkhat in na om vun, tua hile ama hong kilangh ciangin eite sia thinletna taw ih kidim tu a, ama ii hong pai Ni ciangin maizum in ih buk a kul buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Christ sia thumaan thutang hi ci in na he uh hi; tua ahikom na heak tu uh thu sia a maanin a seam peuma Pathian ta hi ci thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pa in ei sia bangza in hong it ziam tel tavun! Ama hong itna lian mama ahikom ei sia Pathian ii tate hong kici hi — tuabang takpi ma ih hi hi. Leitung in Pathian he ngawl ahikom leitung mite in ei hong he ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka it lawmte awng, ei sia tu in Pathian ii tate ih hi hi, ahihang bang suak tu hi ziam ci in kician ngawl lai hi. Ahihang Christ hong kilaak ciangin eite sia ama taw kibang tu ih hi hunlam ih he hi, banghang ziam cile ama sia ahi bang tatakin ih mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Christ sia thiangtho ahi bangma Christ sungah hi lametna a nei mihing peuma ama le ama a thiangtho in kikeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kuama po mawna khialna a vawt peuma in Pathian thukham paltan ahi hi, banghang ziam cile mawna ih ci sia in thukham paltanna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawnate a la keak tu in Christ hong kilangh hi a, ama sungah mawna om ngawl hi ci in na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom Christ taw kipumkhat a, a nungta peuma mawna zom suak nawn ngawl hi; ahihang a kuama po mawna vawt a zom suakte sia ama a mu ngeingawl ahibuale a he ngeingawlte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tate awng, kuama in theamsak heak vun! Christ sia thumaan thutang ahi bangma a kuama po thutangin a seamte sia thumaan thutang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kuama po mawna vawt a zom suakte sia Doaimangpa ii neisa ahi hi, banghang ziam cile a kipat pan ma, Doaimangpa in mawna vawt zo hi. Tua hang ma in Doaimangpa ngamtatna teng a susia tu tatak ma in Pathian Tapa hong kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ta ahi peuma sia mawna vawt a zom suak bua hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian pianzia mama ama sungah om hi; tuaciangin Pathian sia ama Pa hi zo ahikom mawna vawt a zomsuak thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian ii tate le Doaimangpa tate kilaklaw ah, a kilamdanna in hisia ahi hi: thutangin a ngamta ngawl ahibuale ngual a it ngawl khat pawpo sia in Pathian ta ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kipat pan ma na zaak uh thu in: eite khat le khat ih ki it hamtang natu thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eite Cain taw ih kibang buatu hi; ama sia Ngilo Pa ii neisa hi a, a suapuipa tatak Abel thatlum hi. Banghang Cain in ama thatlum ziam? Banghang ziam cile ama ii ngamtatnate sia maan ngawl a, a suapuipa ngamtatnate maan ahihang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka suapuite awng, leitung mite in no hong ensan le, lamdang na sa heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eite in ih suapuite it ih hi hu in, thina nusia a, nuntakna sungah theng zo ih hi hunlam ih he hi. Ngual a it ngawl peuma sia thina vaangletna nuai ah om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngualdang a ensan peuma sia mihing that hi a, mihing that khat in, ama sungah tawntung nuntakna nei ngawl hi ci in na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Christ in eite atu a nuntakna hong piakna hangin eite in ki itna sia bang ziam ci in ih he hi. Tua ahiciang eite zongh, ih suapuite atu ih nuntakna ih piak ngam kul tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hau khat in a cimaw, a suapuipa kisapna mu napi hesuak ngawlin a en thong le Pathian ka it hi, bangbangin ci thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tate awng, ih ki itna sia kam le muk bek ih hisak buatu hi; ngamtatna taw a kilangh ki itna takpi ahi kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahikom thumaan thutak sungah ih om hunlam sia tu a bangin ih he tu hi; Pathian mai ah kimuanna ih nei natu sia hi bang teng hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ih thinsung ah maw ih kisa le, eite ii ih thinsung kitelna sangin Pathian sia lianzaw a, ama in na theampo he siat hi ci in ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka it lawmte awng, ih thin sung ah kithasunna ih nei bua nale Pathian mai ah thinhanna ih nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama thupiakte zui a, ama diksak bang ih ngamtat manin, ama tung pan ih nget pawpo ih nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama hong thupiak sia bang ziam cile a Tapa Jesus Christ ih up tu le Christ ii hong thupiak bangma khat le khat ih ki it natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kuama po Pathian thupiakte a zui le ama sia Pathian taw kipumkhat in a nungta hi a, Pathian zongh ama taw pumkhat in nungta hi. Tuaciang Pathian hong piaksa Thaa hangin Pathian sia ei taw kipumkhatin nungta ahi hunlam, ih he hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka it lawmte awng, Thaa ka nei a ci theampo na um heak vun, ahihang amate nei thaa sia Pathian kung pan hong pai ahile ahi ngawl na sittel tavun. Banghang ziam cile mun theampo ah kamsaang maan ngawlte pai kawkoai zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian Thaa ahile ahi ngawl sia hi bangin na tel thei tu uh hi: Jesus sia mihing khatin hong pai hi a ci pawpo in Pathian kung pan hong pai Thaa nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus huvau hi thu a nial khat pawpo sia Pathian kung pan hong pai Thaa a nei bua hi. Ama nei tua thaa sia Christ ii Ngalpa kung pan hi; tuasia pa hong pai tu hi ci in na za zo uh a, tu in ama sia hi sung leitung ah om zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang ka tate awng, note sia Pathian neisa na hi uh a, kamsaang maan ngawlte na zothal zo uh hi, banghang ziam cile no sungah a om Thaa sia leitung neisa ahite ii sung a om thaa sangin thahat zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua kamsaang maan ngawlte in leitung nate thuson in nei uh hi, tuaciang leitung mite in amate thusonte ngai uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate sia leitung ii neisa ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang ei sia Pathian neisa ih hi hi. Pathian a he peuma in ei thuson hong ngai hi. Pathian neisa ahi ngawl peuma in ei thuson hong ngai bua hi. Tua ahiciang thumaan thutak ii Thaa le a maan ngawl thaa kilamdanna sia, tu sia panin ih khentel thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka it lawmte awng, eite khat le khat ki it tawng, banghang ziam cile itna in Pathian kung pan hong pai hi. Ngual a it thei pawpo sia Pathian ta hi a, Pathian he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngual a it ngawl peuma sia Pathian a he bua hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in itna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang ama tungtawnin nuntakna ih nga thei natu in Tapa khat bek a nei sia leitung ah hong paisakna taw, Pathian in eite hong itna hong lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Itna ih ci sia in hisia ahi hi: eite in Pathian a it ih hi bua a, Pathian in eite hong it manin ih mawna a mai natu in a Tapa hong paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka it lawmte awng, hi bangin Pathian in hong it ahile, eite khat le khat ih ki it tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuama in Pathian mu ngeingawl hi, ahihang eite khat le khat ih ki it le, Pathian sia ei taw pumkhat in hong omkhawm a, tuaciang ama ii itna ei sungah hong cialcingsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eite Pathian taw pumkhat in kinungta a, ama sia ei taw pumkhat in nungta hi ci in maan takin ih tel hi, banghang ziam cile ama in ei tungah ama Thaa hong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Pa in a Tapa sia leitung Hunpa tu in hong paisak hi ci in ih mu a, ngual tungah ih son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khat po in Jesus sia Pathian Tapa hi ci in a pualaak le ama in Pathian taw pumkhatin nungta a, Pathian in ama taw pumkhatin nungta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaciang Pathian ii ei atu a nei itna sia eima mama in ih he a, ih um hi. Pathian in itna hi, tuaciang ki itna sungah a nungta peuma Pathian taw pumkhatin nungta a, Pathian zongh ama taw pumkhatin nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thukhenna Ni in thinhanna ih nei natu in eite sungah ki itna hong cialcingsak hi; hi leitung ah ih nuntakna sia Christ ii nuntakna bangma ahikom, eite tuabang thinhanna ih nei tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Itna sungah launa om ngawl a, a cialcing itna in launa theampo hawlkeak hi. Tua ahiciang, launa sia daan thuakna taw kizom ahikom kiitakna a neite sungah itna kicing om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian in ei hong it masa ahikom eite in ama ih it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khat po in Pathian ka it hi ci napi in a suapuite a ensan le ama sia leilot thusonpa ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile a mu thei a suapuite a it buale a mu thei ngawl Pathian a it thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Christ ii eite hong thupiakna in hi sia hi: Pathian a it peuma in a suapuite zongh a it kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesus sia Messiah hi ci a, a um pawpo sia Pathian ii ta khat ahi hi; tuaciang pa a it khat in a tapa zongh a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian it a, ama thupiakte zuina taw Pathian ii tate a it ih hi hunlam ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian ih itna ii khiakna sia ama thupiakte ih zui hi cinopna ahi hi. Tuaciang ama thupiakte sia ei atu in a haksa lei bua hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Pathian ii tate khat simin leitung zothal thei hi. Tuaciang ih upna taw leitung zawna ih nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kua in leitung zo zo tu ziam? Jesus sia Pathian Tapa hi ci in a um sia bek ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesus Christ sia, tui a kiphumna tui le a thina chisan taw hong paipa ahi hi. Ama in tui nguak taw hong pai ngawlin, tui le chisan taw hong pai hi. Tuaciang Thaa mama in hi thu maan hi ci in tetti pang hi, banghang ziam cile Thaa sia Thumaan thutak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua atu in tetti thum om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thaa, tui le chisan hi a; a thum in a kibang tetti panna nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing tetti panna ih um hi; ahihang Pathian tetti panna khozaw lai a, a Tapa huvau sia ama in tubangin tetti pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom a kuama po Pathian ii Tapa a umte in ama thinsung ah hi tetti nei hi; ahihang a kuama po Pathian a um ngawlte in Pathian sia leilot pa suaksak hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian ii ama Tapa huvau a sonsa teng um ngawl ahihang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua tetti in hi sia hi: Pathian in eite tawntung nuntakna hong pia zo a, hi nuntakna ii a naak sia a Tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tapa a nei a kuama po in hi nuntakna nei hi; Pathian Tapa a nei ngawl pawpo in nuntakna a nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian Tapa a um note — tawntung nuntakna na nei uh hunlam na heak natu in hi lai kong at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eite in Pathian mai ah thinhanna ih nei hi, banghang ziam cile ama deina taw kisi in bang khat po ih ngen le ama in hong za hi, ci in ih muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ih nget simin hong za hi: hi thu, thumaan hi ci in ih heak pan kipan, ama tungah ih nget teng ama in hong pia hi ci thu zongh ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na suapuipa in thina dong a then thei tu ahi ngawl mawna khat a vawt le ama nuntakna a pia tu Pathian munah thu ngetsak in. Hi sia in thina hong then thei mawnate ngawl buang atu in a kizangh thei thu ahi hi. Ahihang thina dong hong then thei mawna om a, tua tungtaang ah Pathian munah thungetsak tu kong ci bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngamtat khialna theampo mawna hi a, ahihang thina dong hong then ngawl mawna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian ii tate kuama in mawna vawt tan viuveu ngawl hi ci in ih he hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian ii Tapa in ama keamcing a, Ngilopa in a susia thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Simlei buppi sia Ngilopa ukna nuai ah om kale, ei sia Pathian neisa ih hi hunlam ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A maan Pathian ih heak natu in Pathian Ta hong pai zo a, teltheina hong pia zo ahi hunlam ih he hi. Eite in a maan Pathian taw pumkhat hi in — ama Tapa Jesus Christ taw pumkhat in ih nungta hi. Hisia in a maan Pathian hi a, tawntung nuntakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tate awng, a maan ngawl pathiante panin noma le noma na kikeam tavun!
  </para>
</usx>
